This repository contains the source code of Dragonkin Trainer ("the Software"). The source is published so that anyone
can read it, check what the trainer does, and build it for themselves. It is NOT open source.

1. What you MAY do
   a. Read and study the source code.
   b. Build the Software from this source and run it on your own computer, for your own single-player use.
   c. Make changes for your own private, personal use, as long as you never share the changed version (see 2).
   d. Link to this repository or to the official download page:
      https://www.nexusmods.com/dragonkinthebanished/mods/10

2. What you may NOT do without written permission from RipXic
   a. Redistribute, re-upload, mirror or share the Software, its source code, compiled builds, or any part of them,
      on any website, mod site, file host, launcher, mod pack, collection, Discord server or anywhere else.
   b. Publish or distribute modified versions, forks, ports or derivative works (including "fixed", "updated",
      translated or re-branded builds).
   c. Use the Software, its source code or any part of it in another product, trainer, tool or project.
   d. Sell, rent, license or otherwise make money from the Software or anything built from it, including putting it
      behind a paywall, subscription or "early access".
   e. Remove or change this license, the copyright notice, or the credits.
   f. Use the Software in online / multiplayer sessions to gain an advantage over other players.

3. GitHub
   This repository is public on GitHub. GitHub's Terms of Service allow GitHub users to view and fork public
   repositories on GitHub itself; that permission exists only as far as GitHub's terms require it. A fork does not
   grant any of the rights withheld in section 2: you may not distribute, release or publish builds from a fork.

