   This license covers everything else in this repository (the trainer's own code, build script and data).

5. No warranty
   The Software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Use it at your own risk and back up your saves.
   The author is not liable for any damage, data loss, bans or other problems that come from using it.

6. Not affiliated
